After CI appears, configure a main branch ruleset under Settings → Rules → Rulesets:
   - Require a pull request before merging
   - Require status checks to pass
   - Require branches to be up to date
   - Select:
     - Backend tests (container)
     - Frontend lint and build
     - Production Docker builds
   - Block force pushes and branch deletion
Do not select Deploy production as a required PR check—it intentionally runs only after merging to main.
After the PR is merged, GitHub Actions will deploy the tested commit to the VPS and verify its /health endpoint. Keep ~/.ssh/vvildan_github_actions private and never commit it.



